- BigCodeBench: Apache-2.0
- Alpaca (tatsu-lab/alpaca): CC BY-NC 4.0
- C4 (allenai/c4): ODC-BY; continuations in the perplexity-leak records start from C4 prefixes
- IFEval, GPQA and other evaluation sets named in the code: their respective licenses

Model organisms are LoRA adapters on Qwen/Qwen3-8B (Apache-2.0), distributed separately on Hugging Face
under gated access.
